Tema Safeer-OS (packaging/tema/Safeer-OS)

gtk-3.0, gtk-4.0 in cinnamon so prekrivne datoteke Safeer, ki uvozijo teme Mint-Y (paket mint-themes).
metacity-1 je prirejena iz Mint-Y (https://github.com/linuxmint/mint-themes),
Copyright 2012-2014 Clement Lefebvre, licenca GPL-3.0-or-later. gtk-2.0 je v paketu povezava na
/usr/share/themes/Mint-Y-Dark-Teal/gtk-2.0.
